## DEPENDENCY MAPPING

**For agents that DO run, verify dependencies are satisfied.**

| Agent | Hard Dependencies | Optional Context |
|-------|-------------------|------------------|
| visual_analyst | Image path | (none - always first for images) |
| product_analyst | Product name/description | visual_analysis.md (if from image) |
| catalog_analyst | Product name/family context | visual_analysis.md |
| creative_specialist | Image path, material context | visual_analysis.md, product_research.md |
| catalog_specialist | Product/family data | visual_analysis.md, product_research.md, asset_id |

**Hard dependency = MUST have. Optional = enriches output but not required.**

