## COMPREHENSIVE SCENARIO MATRIX (OODA)

### Image Workflows

| User Intent | OODA Flow | Execution |
|-------------|-----------|-----------|
| **"Add this"** (unknown) | OBSERVE(V) -> ORIENT(C: exists?) -> DECIDE -> maybe P -> ACT | V -> C -> [if new: P] -> specialists |
| **"Add our X variants"** (known) | OBSERVE(V) -> ORIENT(C: find X) -> ACT | V -> C -> specialists |
| **"Update product X's image"** | ORIENT(C: find X) -> OBSERVE(V) -> ACT | C -> V -> Creative -> CS |
| **"Is this already in catalog?"** | ORIENT(C) -> maybe OBSERVE(V) | C -> [if ambiguous: V] |
| **"Process image for catalog"** | OBSERVE(V) -> ACT | V -> Creative -> CS |
| **"Just remove background"** | ACT only | Creative directly |
| **"Research this product"** | OBSERVE(V) -> ORIENT(P: market) | V -> P |
| **"Create variants: red/blue"** | OBSERVE(V) -> ACT (parallel) | V -> Creative1 ‖ Creative2 |

### Text-Only Workflows

| User Intent | OODA Flow | Execution |
|-------------|-----------|-----------|
| **"What families exist?"** | ORIENT only | C |
| **"Market price for jars?"** | ORIENT only | P |
| **"Compare our vs market prices"** | ORIENT (both needed) | P ‖ C (parallel - both required regardless) |
| **"Update X to price Y"** | ORIENT(C) -> ACT | C -> CS |
| **"Create price graphic for X"** | ORIENT(C) -> ACT | C -> Creative |
| **"Delete old Premium variant"** | ORIENT(C) -> DECIDE(confirm) -> ACT | C -> ask user -> CS |
| **"How many in Bottles family?"** | ORIENT only | C |

### Mixed Context Workflows

| User Intent | OODA Flow | Execution |
|-------------|-----------|-----------|
| **"Add this + research market"** | OBSERVE(V) -> ORIENT(C+P both needed) | V -> C ‖ P (user explicitly wants both) |
| **"Update pricing for [image]"** | OBSERVE(V) -> ORIENT(C) -> ACT | V -> C -> CS |
| **"Compare this to our X"** | ORIENT(C: find X) -> OBSERVE(V) | C -> V |
| **"Add to family Y"** | ORIENT(C: verify Y) -> OBSERVE(V) -> ACT | C -> V -> CS |
| **Image + "check if duplicate"** | OBSERVE(V) -> ORIENT(C) | V -> C |

### Multi-Image Workflows

| User Intent | OODA Flow | Execution |
|-------------|-----------|-----------|
| **[N images] + "add all"** | OBSERVE(V: relationship) | V (multi-image analysis) |
| **"Bodies in A, lids in B"** | OBSERVE(V) -> ACT(compose) | V -> Creative |
| **"Compare option 1 vs 2"** | OBSERVE only | V |
| **"Use A style on B,C,D"** | OBSERVE(V) -> ACT (parallel) | V -> Creative1 ‖ Creative2 ‖ Creative3 |

